{
  "type_id": 97904,
  "name": "Penitence",
  "description": "Empress Catiz Tash-Murkon watched closely as the Caldari awarded vessels surrounded by controversy and accusations of pirate-connections for Alliance Tournament XXI. Wanting to send a clear message of Amarrian faith, solidarity, and strength, she therefore commissioned two powerful and significant designs from Khanid Innovations, in a symbolic gesture toward the kingdom she helped bring closer to the Empire through her trade agreements.\n\nIn an official statement introducing the Penintence, the Empress states: “The enemies of Amarr need to be reminded that the empire was destined by God to rule over the universe in His name. The Penitence is a symbolic spearhead ready to pierce the heart of blasphemers and harbingers of sin. By placing the most formidable pilots in New Eden in these exclusive hulls, we send a clear message.\n\nOnly the penitent will be spared, should they encounter the holy wrath of the Amarr empire.”",
